<title>INDIA: India Coats Viyella 1996 net down.</title>
<headline>India Coats Viyella 1996 net down.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>	     (in million rupees unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		91.5   vs     95.1</p>
<p>    Turnover	     9,517.1   vs  8,807.6</p>
<p>    Interest		 456.8   vs    382.3</p>
<p>    Depreciation	   253.5   vs    235.6</p>
<p>    Taxation		  20.0   vs	0.2</p>
<p>    Div (in rupees)	  1.0   vs	1.0</p>
<p>Note - Textiles and garments maker Coats Viyella India Ltd is a subsidiary of Britain's Coats Viyella Plc. It said profitability was hit by &quot;inequitable impact of thread excise duties and high interest cost&quot;. Disruption of power supplies in the first half also affected production, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>--Bombay Newsroom +91-22-265-9000</p>
